  "description": "Jin, a concubine and ballerina living at the prince’s side. Just as he endures everything to stand on stage, Lev, a rising bourgeois figure who is shaking up high society, appears before him. Jin gradually lets down his guard in the face of Lev’s affectionate gaze and dangerously gentle warmth, and for the first time, begins to dream of the life he has always longed for... \n\nBut the true feelings hidden beneath the dazzling lights always take the longest to reveal themselves.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
